<h2>🕹 What Are PSP Cheats?</h2>

<p>

PSP cheats are special codes that modify different aspects of a game. They can unlock hidden content, increase player statistics, provide unlimited resources, activate secret abilities, and make difficult missions much easier.

</p>

<p>

These cheat codes are stored inside <strong>.INI</strong> files and are read by the PPSSPP emulator whenever cheats are enabled. Every game has its own unique Game ID, so it''s important to use cheat files that match your game''s region and version.

</p>

<div class="warning">

<b>⚠ Important</b>

Some cheat codes only work with specific game versions (USA, Europe or Japan). If a cheat doesn''t appear inside PPSSPP, first confirm that the Game ID matches the cheat file you''re using.

</div>

</div>

