    <h2>🔥 What is Crash of the Titans PSP?</h2>

    <p>

      <strong>Crash of the Titans</strong> is an action-adventure beat ’em up game originally released on multiple platforms including PSP (PlayStation Portable). It features the beloved character <strong>Crash Bandicoot</strong> in an all-new adventure where he must fight mutated enemies and take down powerful bosses called “Titans.” This version brings fast-paced combat, weapon upgrades, creative levels, and colorful worlds tailored for portable gaming.

    </p>

    <img class="game-img" src="https://via.placeholder.com/600x350.png?text=Crash+of+the+Titans+PSP" alt="Crash of the Titans PSP gameplay" />

  </div>

  <div class="section">

